// IPC antenna + screen-face content ported from NovaSector/Bubberstation/S.P.L.U.R.T-Station-13. IPC
// customization turned out to already be a fully-wired standard content category (hair slot = antennae,
// facial_hair slot = screen face, both gated by species_allowed = list(SPECIES_IPC)) rather than a
// separate render path -- no new architecture was needed, same mechanical port as every other category.
//
// Antennae: 21 new styles from S.P.L.U.R.T-Station-13's modular_splurt/icons/mob/ipc_antennas.dmi.
// (NovaSector/Bubberstation's own antenna sets are a strict subset of what BS12SOYH's native catalog
// already has, so those added nothing; SPLURT-tg's modular_zzplurt copy of this same 21-style set has
// primary/secondary/tertiary color-region variants -- the modular_splurt copy used here has the same
// shapes as one simple flat layer already, so it was preferred over dropping color-region detail.)
/datum/sprite_accessory/hair/ipc/synth
	icon = 'icons/mob/species/anthro/ipc_antennas.dmi'

